✖ engine: unknown engine "bogus" (valid: llamacpp, mlx, ollama, sglang, trtllm, vllm)
    → set engine.preferred in $DATA/.opod/config.yaml (or OPOD_ENGINE) to one of the valid names
▶ llama.cpp: not installed — needed only for sharded models or engine.preferred=llamacpp
